1
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,020
我们真的得走吗
Do we really have to leave?

2
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:24,000
是啊  我们不能再多待几天吗
Yeah, can't we just stay a couple more days?

3
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:25,240
我知道  我也很难受
I know -- it's killing me.

4
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,880
明天是阿波罗剧院的开麦之夜
Tomorrow's open-mic night at the Apollo.

5
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:29,420
我们还会再回来  我也喜欢这里
Look, we'll all come back. I love it here, too.

6
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:31,220
跟纽约人相比  我很放松
Compared to New Yorkers, I'm laid-back.

7
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:32,740
来抱抱
Now, come on.

8
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:35,330
快上楼收拾行李  不然你们可能赶不上飞机
Get upstairs and pack, or else you might miss your flight.

9
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,678
在纽约度过美好的一周后
After a great week in New York,

10
00:00:37,759 --> 00:00:40,530
我得去罗利参加卡罗来纳州橱柜大会
I had to get to Raleigh for the Carolina Closet Caucus.

11
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,052
菲尔和我一直都想
Phil and I have always wanted

12
00:00:42,072 --> 00:00:43,382
一起开车周游全国
to drive across the country together,

13
00:00:43,443 --> 00:00:44,693
所以我们想来个自驾游
so we thought we'd make a road trip of it.

14
00:00:44,703 --> 00:00:46,830
-再见  孩子们  -再见
- Bye! Bye, guys! - Bye! Bye! Bye!

15
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,800
我们会想你们的
We'll miss you!

16
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,800
就这样决定了  我们再住一晚
Okay, here's the deal -- We're staying another night.

17
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:51,480
什么
What?

18
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:53,160
你听到爸妈说的话了  他们说不行
You heard mom and dad. They said no.

19
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:55,700
我们还是会在他们之前到家  他们不会知道
Well, we'll still get home before them. They'll never know.

20
00:00:55,885 --> 00:00:57,490
拜托  安迪和我刚分手
Oh, come on. Andy and I just broke up.

21
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,401
我还没准备好回去面对生活
I'm not ready to go back and face life.

22
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:01,120
我们要怎么付房费啊
Come on, how would we even pay for the hotel?

23
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:03,320
我们可以用卢克的园游会赔偿金
We can use Luke's carnival settlement money.

24
00:01:03,460 --> 00:01:05,260
不行  那是我赚的
No way! I earned that.

25
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:06,640
摔下游乐设施的是我
I'm the one who fell off that ride.

26
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,160
受罪的其实是我们
We were the ones who really suffered.

27
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:10,020
在你的头消肿之前  我们都不能开灯
We couldn't turn on lights or make loud noises

28
00:01:10,020 --> 00:01:11,340
或者发出很大的声音
until your head got small again.

29
00:01:11,340 --> 00:01:13,820
我们不能用那笔钱  那是给我上大学用的
We can't use that money. It's for college.

30
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:20,340
好啦  好啦  花了吧
Okay, okay, let's spend it.

31
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:24,300
瞧瞧  我们一直没去成的寿司餐厅
Oh, look -- that sushi restaurant we never made it to.

32
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:25,740
是啊  我们努力过了
Oh, yeah. We tried.

33
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:27,820
可是他们从没刚好有五人桌
They just never had a table for five.

34
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:30,481
但这一趟我们玩得很开心  对吧
We had a lot of fun, though, didn't we?

35
00:01:30,522 --> 00:01:31,760
-是啊  -是啊
- Yes, we did. - Yeah.

36
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,225
可惜的就是
Never got to get on

37
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:35,180
没有乘坐到中央公园游园马车
one of those horse-drawn carriages through the park.

38
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,480
艾丽克斯过敏
Alex's allergies.

39
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:38,940
都不知道原来有人能单对马车皮革过敏
Didn't know you could be allergic to carriage leather.

40
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:41,930
但这依然是一段很棒的家庭时光
Still, just so much good family time.

41
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:41,961
谨以此集，献给轴人浓子，感谢你的付出
摩登这个大家庭，永远印著你的名字
R.I.P.

42
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:42,900
家庭时光
Family time.

43
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:46,580
你的想法跟我一样吗
Are you thinking what I'm thinking?

44
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:47,620
你可以不去开会
You could blow off the convention.

45
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:49,360
我们可以待在这里  度过浪漫的几天
We could stay here for a romantic few days

46
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:51,280
但别告诉孩子们  因为我们刚逼他们回家了
but never tell the kids because we just made them go home?

47
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:51,860
没错
Yes!

48
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:55,920
这是你第一次答对这个问题
That is the first time you've ever answered that question right.

49
00:01:56,442 --> 00:01:57,433
我不要今天死
Not today!

50
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:14,100
小卡  外面天气真好
Oh! Cam, it is so beautiful outside.

51
00:02:14,104 --> 00:02:15,542
你得...
You got to --

52
00:02:16,740 --> 00:02:17,350
好吧
Ohhhh...right.

53
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,677
我们决定去密苏里州度过夏天
We decided to spend the summer in Missouri.

54
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:22,880
但我们过来后发现小卡的奶奶躺在临终床上
But we arrived to find Cam's grandma on her deathbed.

55
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:25,560
从感恩节到现在完全没变
Right where we left her at Thanksgiving.

56
00:02:26,660 --> 00:02:29,380
我希望你能多体谅
Hey, um, I wish you'd be a little more mindful

57
00:02:29,380 --> 00:02:30,660
我的家庭情况
of my family situation.

58
00:02:30,762 --> 00:02:31,990
抱歉  我没意识到祈祷
I'm sorry -- I didn't realize the vigil

59
00:02:32,010 --> 00:02:33,460
转移到了公用区域
had drifted out to the common areas.

60
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,300
小卡  拜托
Cam, come on.

61
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:37,220
她都95岁了  靠设备维持生命
She's 95 years old and plugged into a wall.

62
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,540
也许是时候...
Maybe it's time to, you know...

63
00:02:38,540 --> 00:02:40,120
什么  你什么意思  米奇尔
What? What are you saying, Mitchell?

64
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,640
我们该停了设备吗
That we should pull the plug?

65
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,661
愿上帝怜悯你
Lord o' mercy.

66
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:46,878
你有轮班去陪过奶奶吗
Have you even taken your turn sitting with Gram?

67
00:02:47,380 --> 00:02:49,120
没有  她才不想要我陪  她恨我
No, she doesn't want me there. She hates me.

68
00:02:49,660 --> 00:02:50,460
又来了
This again.

69
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:52,460
小卡  她称我为"那娘炮"
Cam, she refers to me as "the sissy."

70
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:53,900
你听错了
You heard that wrong.

71
00:02:54,100 --> 00:02:56,220
因为她继承的假牙  我们很难听懂她的话
She's hard to understand because of the dentures she inherited.

72
00:02:56,220 --> 00:02:58,220
你知道那假牙是儿童钢琴的琴键做的吧
You know they were made from the keys of a child's piano.

73
00:02:58,220 --> 00:03:00,340
而且对昏迷的人能说什么啊
What do you even say to someone in a coma?

74
00:03:00,636 --> 00:03:02,026
妈妈读著她的诗
Well, Mama's reading her poetry.

75
00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:03,320
莉莉朗诵《圣经》
Lily's reciting scripture.

76
00:03:03,415 --> 00:03:05,250
小帕和我打算唱我们小时候改编的歌
Pam and I are gonna sing a song we wrote when we were younger,

77
00:03:05,290 --> 00:03:06,037
《甜蜜之家阿拉奶奶》
"Sweet Home Ala-gramma."

78
00:03:06,743 --> 00:03:07,772
好  教我唱吧
Okay, yeah, t-teach me that.

79
00:03:08,034 --> 00:03:09,753
抱歉  她是你的阿拉奶奶吗
Oh, I'm sorry -- Is she your Ala-gramma?

80
00:03:11,020 --> 00:03:12,020
好吧  我再自己想出点什么
Oh, fine. I'll think of something.

81
00:03:14,717 --> 00:03:17,519
* 前进... *
* Onward -- *

82
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:19,280
抱歉
Sorry.

83
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,160
这衣领好痒
This collar itches.

84
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:26,840
别挠了  你们看起来都很帅
Stop it. You all look so handsome.

85
00:03:27,193 --> 00:03:28,250
我们看起来像是三剑客
We look like The Three Amigos.

86
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:29,609
我们在华雷斯
We were in Juarez

87
00:03:29,649 --> 00:03:32,688
参加我19岁的可爱表妹玛丽索的第三次婚礼
for my sweet 19-year-old cousin Marisol's third wedding.

88
00:03:32,910 --> 00:03:34,520
真是太美了
It was so beautiful.

89
00:03:35,060 --> 00:03:37,206
谢天谢地他们按时挖通了地道
Thank God that they finished that tunnel in time

90
00:03:37,246 --> 00:03:38,440
她爸爸才能及时偷渡赶到
for her father to make it.

91
00:03:39,525 --> 00:03:42,170
杰  别玩手机了  你错过了一切
Ay, Jay, stop with the phone. You're missing everything.

92
00:03:42,180 --> 00:03:44,467
等等  我在为本周末的父亲节
Hang on -- I'm trying to lock up some sausages

93
00:03:44,507 --> 00:03:45,650
订一些香肠
for Father's Day this weekend.

94
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:47,335
要是等到最后才订
You wait till the last minute, you wind up eating

95
00:03:47,340 --> 00:03:49,800
就只能跟嬉皮士一样  吃鸡肉苹果味香肠了
chicken and apple, like some damn hippie.

96
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:50,440
双击
Double click!

97
00:03:53,020 --> 00:03:59,250
那妖妇  曼尼  跟我来跳舞
La Diabla. Manny, come dance with me.

98
00:03:59,260 --> 00:04:00,751
我去  真他娘好吃
Son of a bitch, that's good!

99
00:04:01,260 --> 00:04:02,700
你好  杰
Hola, Jay.

100
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:04,680
桑娅
Oh, hey...Sonia.

101
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,600
我看见歌洛莉亚躲著我了
I see Gloria's avoiding me.

102
00:04:06,798 --> 00:04:09,258
她还在气我转发了那封群发邮件给她
She's still mad because I forwarded her that mass e-mail.

103
00:04:09,945 --> 00:04:11,864
也许吧  也可能是上次你们见面时
Could be that, or it could be the last time you saw her,

104
00:04:11,884 --> 00:04:13,460
你想抢走我  再杀了她
you tried to steal me and kill her.

105
00:04:14,260 --> 00:04:15,760
我姐姐怎么样
So, how is my sister?

106
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:17,060
很好啊  好极了
Fantastic. Great.

107
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:19,940
当然了  有了乔和她的辣酱生意
'Course, with Joe and also her hot-sauce business,

108
00:04:20,020 --> 00:04:21,100
她可有得忙了
she got a lot on her plate.

109
00:04:21,100 --> 00:04:23,260
你吃过这种墨西哥曲奇吗
Hey, have you tried one of these Mexican cookies?

110
00:04:23,380 --> 00:04:24,420
我们称呼它为曲奇而已
They just call them cookies.

111
00:04:24,420 --> 00:04:25,580
我一会儿要跟歌洛莉亚谈谈
I'll speak with Gloria later.

112
00:04:25,580 --> 00:04:27,560
我得先把这个放到礼物桌上
I have to drop this at the gift table.

113
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:29,680
太好了
Great.

114
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,960
我的座位发冷  花儿也都枯萎了
My seat is cold, and the flowers wilted.

115
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:36,760
看来我妹妹来过这里了
I see that my sister has been here.

116
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,680
你能放下那仇了吗
Will you get over that?

117
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,520
她刚刚很友好  我们聊了聊乔
She couldn't have been nicer. We talked about Joe.

118
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:42,040
我告诉她你的辣酱生意做得有多好
I told her how well your hot-sauce business was going.

119
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,820
对了  你吃过这种曲奇了吗
By the way, have you tried one of these cookies?

120
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,800
你干嘛告诉她辣酱的事
Why did you tell her about the sauce?

121
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,300
各位  拿上你们的东西
Everybody, get your things.

122
00:04:47,580 --> 00:04:49,460
我们得马上离开华雷斯
We have to leave Juarez right now!

123
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:52,020
什么  我花了45分钟才穿上这身衣服
What?! It took me 45 minutes to get into this outfit!

124
00:04:52,020 --> 00:04:53,700
你知道桑娅会有多神经病
You know how crazy Sonia can be.

125
00:04:53,700 --> 00:04:55,300
现在她一定嫉妒死了  因为得知
She's gonna be so jealous now that she knows

126
00:04:55,364 --> 00:04:56,633
我是个非常成功的女商人
that I am a very successful businesswoman.

127
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,420
那生意你不是还亏了400刀吗
Aren't you 400 bucks in the hole on that thing?

128
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,560
你不觉得这样不好吗
You don't think this looks bad --

129
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,780
晚餐开始前就离开这里
us walking out before dinner?

130
00:05:02,339 --> 00:05:05,380
乔发烧了  他...他在大出汗呢
Joe has a fever, and he -- he's sweating very much.

131
00:05:05,390 --> 00:05:06,515
没有  我才没有
No, I'm not.

132
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:11,000
我要收回我说的话
I'm gonna reverse what I said.

133
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,560
中央公园租狗生意  是能大赚特赚的点子
Central Park dog rentals -- million-dollar idea.

134
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:15,496
对啊  而且可能度假让我嗨到糊涂了
Yeah, and maybe it's just the high of being on vacation,

135
00:05:15,516 --> 00:05:18,560
但是还有比美洲旅鸽[已灭绝]更高贵的鸟吗
but is there a bird more majestic than the American pigeon?

136
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,820
穿衣服  我们出去吃早餐披萨
Get dressed. We're going out for walk-around breakfast pizza.

137
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,440
糟糕  忘拿钥匙了
Oh! Shoot. Forgot my room key.

138
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:33,960
我得给我爸拍一张这种镶板的照片
Oh! I've got to get a picture of this paneling for my dad.

139
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:36,797
芳香型雪松木刨花板  完全改变这个行业
Aromatic cedar flakeboard -- game a-changed.

140
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:39,240
我爱死我的性感小衣柜狂了
I love my sexy little closet nerd.

141
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,060
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

142
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,840
我去迅速泡个澡
I'm gonna take a quick tub.

143
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:43,540
我们得给孩子们打电话查查岗  假装"在路上"
We should check in with the kids from "the road."

144
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,040
对对对
Oh, right, right.

145
00:05:45,060 --> 00:05:47,710
我们还得去给酒搞点冰块来
We should also maybe get some ice for drinks.

146
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:50,410
我们去大堂等他吧  反正我得喝点咖啡
Let's wait for him in the lobby. I need coffee anyway.

147
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:52,991
隔壁房间的人做爱声大得我一晚上没睡
The people next door kept me up all night with their sex noises.

148
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,020
我听到了结尾部分
I caught the end of that.

149
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:55,540
那男的听著像个被吓到的鬼
He sounded like a scared ghost.

150
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:02,100
天啊  是老妈
Oh, my God. It's Mom.

151
00:06:02,100 --> 00:06:03,440
保持冷静
Uh, well, stay calm.

152
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:05,320
就说我们在家  我们昨晚飞回来的
Uh, we're home, we flew in last night.

153
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:06,980
走吧  她肯定想跟卢克说话啊
Oh. Come on. She's gonna want to talk to Luke.

154
00:06:11,060 --> 00:06:11,840
老妈
Hi, Mom.

155
00:06:11,940 --> 00:06:13,040
亲爱的
Hi, sweetie.

156
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,780
从西弗吉尼亚给你打电话哦
I'm coming to you from West Virginia.

157
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,940
你们俩今天要做什么呀
What are you girls doing today?

158
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,500
我和艾丽克斯刚出来逛街
Oh, you know, me and Alex just out shopping.

159
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,720
你在跟谁打电话
Who are you talking to?

160
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,460
老爸  你在跟谁打电话
Dad. Who are you talking to?

161
00:06:22,545 --> 00:06:23,130
-老妈  -老妈
- Mom. - Mom.

162
00:06:23,251 --> 00:06:23,674
-俩闺女  -卢克
- The girls. - Luke.

163
00:06:25,460 --> 00:06:26,180
等下
Hold on.

164
00:06:26,900 --> 00:06:28,397
我告诉她们我们在西弗吉尼亚
I told them we were in West Virginia.

165
00:06:28,417 --> 00:06:29,529
-你说什么  -肯塔基
- What did you say? - Kentucky.

166
00:06:29,671 --> 00:06:30,490
老妈以为我们在逛街
Mom thinks we're shopping.

167
00:06:30,500 --> 00:06:32,082
我跟老爸说我在给我们做早餐
I told Dad I was making us breakfast.

168
00:06:32,203 --> 00:06:33,460
你什么时候给我们做过早餐了
When have you ever made us breakfast?!

169
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,031
好吧  姑娘们  我得走了
Okay, girls, um, I got to go.

170
00:06:35,052 --> 00:06:36,384
-我们也是  开车注意安全哦  -拜
- Us too. Drive safely. - Bye.

171
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:38,120
哥们  我得走了
Hey, buddy, I should get going.

172
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,340
有个警察过来了
There's a cop walking towards us.

173
00:06:39,340 --> 00:06:40,840
可能是因为我们停在州界线上怪怪的
I guess it looks weird with us parked right here

174
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:42,480
我前座在肯塔基境内
on the state border with me up here in Kentucky

175
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:45,060
-你妈后座在西弗吉尼亚境内  -知道了
- and your mom in the back seat over in West Virginia. - Got it.

176
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,680
我得把早餐打包好
I should probably finish packing up the breakfast

177
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,900
送到她们正在逛的商场去了
I'm bringing to the girls at the shopping mall where they're shopping.

178
00:06:49,119 --> 00:06:50,853
-好吧  再见  -再见
- Okay. See ya, pal. - See ya.

179
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:53,780
-就是这么简单  -搞定
- That's how you do that. - Done.

180
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,980
* 甜蜜之家  阿拉奶奶 *
* Sweet home Ala-gramma *

181
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,940
* 双眼与头发都是美丽的蓝 *
* Eyes and hair of gorgeous blue *

182
00:07:01,540 --> 00:07:02,480
我一会儿再回来
I'm gonna come back.

183
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:03,600
别别别  你来得正好
No, no, no. I'm glad you're up here.

184
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:04,720
-我们一会儿再唱  -对对对
- We can finish later. - Yeah, yeah.

185
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:07,200
她喜欢你抚著她头发  揉她的脚
She likes it when you stroke her hair and rub her feet.

186
00:07:07,620 --> 00:07:08,920
米奇尔  你要确保她舌头是湿润的
And, Mitchell, make sure her tongue stays moist.

187
00:07:08,940 --> 00:07:09,514
我要怎么...
How would I -- Ugh.

188
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,280
奶奶好
Hey, Grams.

189
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:14,600
昏...昏迷的感觉怎么样
How's -- How's the coma?

190
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,680
我的天啊  天啊
Oh, my God. Oh, my God!

191
00:07:18,466 --> 00:07:19,520
你想说什么吗
A-Are you trying to say something?

192
00:07:22,897 --> 00:07:23,702
奶奶  很疼  撒...撒手
Grams. Ow, that hurts. Let -- let go.

193
00:07:23,779 --> 00:07:24,940
奶奶  快撒手
Grams, l-let go.

194
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:26,610
撒手吧  奶奶  撒手吧  奶奶
Let go, Grams. Let go, Grams!

195
00:07:26,620 --> 00:07:28,560
你在跟她说什么鬼话
What the hell are you telling her?

196
00:07:29,740 --> 00:07:31,140
怎么回事
What happened?!

197
00:07:31,809 --> 00:07:32,751
我刚刚进来
I just walked in,

198
00:07:32,761 --> 00:07:35,190
米奇尔让她撒手  她就真的撒手人寰了
and Mitchell was telling her to let go, and she did!

199
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:36,200
放手  我是说撒手别抓我头发
Oh, let go -- let go of my hair.

200
00:07:36,210 --> 00:07:37,758
打给马场的人  叫医生来
Somebody call the race track! Get the doctor!

201
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:44,220
-好多人来啊  -当然
- Nice turnout. - Sure is.

202
00:07:44,220 --> 00:07:46,620
太奶奶肯定不爽看到这么多人来她家
Grams would hate all these people on her property.

203
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,820
的确会
She sure would.

204
00:07:49,500 --> 00:07:49,780
你好
Hi.

205
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:54,000
天啊  我觉得你的家人都在狠狠地瞪我
Oh, my God. I can feel your family staring daggers at me.

206
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:56,380
真不敢相信他们觉得是我杀了奶奶
Can't believe they think I killed Grams.

207
00:07:56,843 --> 00:07:58,370
好像我真的会叫她撒手人寰一样
Like I'd really be telling her to let go of life.

208
00:07:58,380 --> 00:07:59,759
他们怀疑你也正常
Well, you can see how they'd wonder

209
00:07:59,819 --> 00:08:01,370
谁让你把行李箱放进她房间  像要入住
after you put your suitcase in her room.

210
00:08:01,380 --> 00:08:03,090
你这么说是站在他们那边吗
It sounds like you're taking their side.

211
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:05,000
你不能怪他们质疑你的故事
You can't blame them for questioning your story

212
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:08,080
声称一名昏迷中的关节炎患者揪你的头发
about a comatose arthritic woman pulling your hair.

213
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:10,040
这不是故事  这是真事
Not a story. A thing that happened.

214
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:10,860
-好吧  -好
- Fine. - Fine.

215
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:14,911
你把她爱看的电视剧
And you didn't help your case

216
00:08:14,931 --> 00:08:16,163
意外洗掉了也更让人怀疑啊
by accidentally erasing her "Matlocks".

217
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:17,820
天啊  能"放下"了吗
Oh, my God! Just drop it!

218
00:08:18,380 --> 00:08:20,600
不  不  我不是...
No, not -- not the... No. I -- I...

219
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:25,480
好吧  你们打算什么时候回来
Okay, so, when do you guys think you're gonna be back?

220
00:08:25,601 --> 00:08:26,953
绝对会在父亲节前
Definitely by Father's Day.

221
00:08:26,980 --> 00:08:28,660
好吧  我们想你们
Oh, okay. Well, we miss you guys.

222
00:08:28,660 --> 00:08:30,540
不过也还剩三天呢
But at least it's still only three more days.

223
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,700
是不是有点太冒险
Was it a little risky?

224
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:36,400
只要出手的是专家就没问题
Not as long as the master did the talking.

225
00:08:38,192 --> 00:08:39,521
我爱你们  再见
Aww. Love you both. Bye.

226
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,800
我们想你们
We miss you guys.

227
00:08:41,172 --> 00:08:42,430
我得出去漆邮箱了
Got to run outside and paint the mailbox.

228
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,098
你只需要说句再见就好
All you had to do was say goodbye.

229
00:08:44,583 --> 00:08:46,230
这下我们回家的时候还得漆邮箱
Now we have to paint the mailbox when we get home.

230
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:46,846
抱歉
Sorry.

231
00:08:47,189 --> 00:08:48,279
我也是因为看到
It just popped into my head

232
00:08:48,300 --> 00:08:50,640
自由女神像拿著油漆刷才脱口而出
when I saw the Statue of Liberty holding that paintbrush.

233
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:54,900
就是她为美国刷出自由的工具[是火把]
You know, what she used to paint freedom in America.

234
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,080
好吧
Yeah.

235
00:08:57,780 --> 00:09:00,680
一个好谎的关键在于不节外生枝
The key to a good lie is keep it simple.

236
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,360
我一直夸它也没意义
Well, why don't I stop talking

237
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:06,040
不如直接给你带点尝尝吧
about how good it is here and just bring you some?

238
00:09:06,740 --> 00:09:08,160
好吧  再见
Okay. Bye-bye.

239
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:11,280
我们得去买一块亚利桑那辣味羊奶酪
We need to pick up a wheel of Arizona spicy sheep cheese.

240
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:12,860
你就不能只说再见吗
Couldn't you just say goodbye?!

241
00:09:13,332 --> 00:09:14,610
克莱尔  那上面写著"不要大声喧哗"
Claire, the sign says "No loud noises."

242
00:09:14,620 --> 00:09:15,901
你会吓到魔术师大卫·布莱恩
You'll scare David Blaine.

243
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:20,560
所以  他就在果冻里坐四天吗
So, he just sits in jello for four days?

244
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:22,080
我没懂这算哪门子魔术
I don't get how that's magic.

245
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:22,930
你不会懂的
You wouldn't.

246
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:27,080
我真希望爸爸也在这里
I wish Dad was here.

247
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,420
他肯定会超爱这个
He'd love this.

248
00:09:28,560 --> 00:09:30,210
他不在  我们也不在这里
Well, he isn't, and neither are we.

249
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:34,130
还记得卢克以前把它叫成"果弄"吗
Remember how Luke used to call it "jeh-woh"?

250
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:37,880
真讨厌我不能跟他分享这个
I hate that I can't share this with him.

251
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:40,180
魔术不是用来搞秘密与欺骗别人的
Magic isn't about secrets and tricking people.

252
00:09:40,627 --> 00:09:41,230
菲尔  别闹
Phil! Get it together.

253
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,980
跟你的男朋友大卫·布莱恩一样
Like your boyfriend, David Blaine,

254
00:09:42,980 --> 00:09:45,280
我们得把这个秘密带进棺材里
we're taking how we did this to the grave.

255
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:47,540
我只是很遗憾他错过了这些
I just feel bad that he's missing out.

256
00:09:47,540 --> 00:09:48,880
这是我跟他的专属爱好
This is our thing.

257
00:09:49,540 --> 00:09:51,540
你永远不准告诉他这事
You will never tell him about this,

258
00:09:51,540 --> 00:09:54,860
否则无照经营园游会没摔死你  我们会弄死你
or we will finish what that unlicensed carnival started, okay?

259
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:58,000
我们打算飞回去过父亲节的那天早上
The morning we were set to fly back for Father's Day,

260
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:00,640
因中西部地区的一场风暴导致航班取消
a storm in the midwest canceled our flight.

261
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:04,520
我们先去机场吧  肯定有航班的
Let's just get to the airport, and we will find a flight.

262
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:06,660
-出租车  -该死  被人抢了
- Taxi! - Damn it! It's already taken!

263
00:10:07,300 --> 00:10:09,600
我好像买到了在丹佛转机的航班
Okay, so I think I got us on a flight through Denver.

264
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:10,580
你介意坐中间吗
Do you mind the middle seat?

265
00:10:11,106 --> 00:10:12,146
能不摔就行啊
If it'll help.

266
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:14,160
不要什么事都扯上园游会的事好吗
This can't all be carnival-related.

267
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:15,480
出租车
Taxi!

268
00:10:16,620 --> 00:10:17,060
出租车
Taxi!

269
00:10:18,645 --> 00:10:20,396
杰  我本来打算来做香肠的
Ay, Jay, I was going to cook the sausage.

270
00:10:20,416 --> 00:10:21,081
我不介意
Hey, I don't mind.

271
00:10:21,140 --> 00:10:22,780
他决定接手应该是因为
He's taking over because we screwed up

272
00:10:22,780 --> 00:10:23,980
我们搞砸了前几个父亲节
the last few Father's Days.

273
00:10:23,980 --> 00:10:25,320
别说傻话  我来就行
Don't be silly. I got this.

274
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:28,780
我只要一想到前几个父亲节
When I think of the last few Father's Days,

275
00:10:28,780 --> 00:10:30,120
就气得要爆炸
I quake with rage.

276
00:10:30,620 --> 00:10:33,040
不介意的话可以多花点心思啊
Hey, maybe put a little thought into it.

277
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:34,500
比如不要叫披萨
Maybe we don't order the pizza.

278
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:35,920
真要叫的话
And if we do,

279
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:38,380
也许应该点够疯狂面包
maybe we get enough crazy bread for everybody.

280
00:10:38,380 --> 00:10:40,320
抱歉  到底是谁把父亲节变成
I'm sorry, but who made Father's Day

281
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:42,320
节日界里的讨人厌拖油瓶啊
the dirty stepchild of holidays?!

282
00:10:43,820 --> 00:10:45,060
父亲节连首歌都没有
We don't even have a song.

283
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:47,100
-爸爸  -怎么了
- Daddy? - What?

284
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:48,209
我给你准备了礼物
Got you a present.

285
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,260
不愧是我儿子
That's my boy!

286
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:51,640
让我们看看  里面是什么
Let's see. What do we got in here?

287
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:53,840
一个冰桶
Hey. An ice bucket.

288
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:57,260
我看到曼尼拿走酒店的洗发水
I saw Manny take shampoos from the hotel.

289
00:10:57,260 --> 00:10:59,020
所以我也拿了些东西
So I took some things, too.

290
00:10:59,020 --> 00:11:00,360
一些稍大件的东西
Then some bigger things.

291
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,700
我喜欢偷东西
I like stealing.

292
00:11:01,882 --> 00:11:02,967
这会让我心跳加快
It makes my heart go fast.

293
00:11:03,349 --> 00:11:04,816
冰桶里有什么呢
And what's in the ice bucket?

294
00:11:06,332 --> 00:11:08,060
一个吹风筒  谢谢  亲爱的
A hair dryer. Thanks, buddy.

295
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:11,640
谁这么早就来了
Who's here so early?

296
00:11:15,141 --> 00:11:15,845
桑娅  你来这里干嘛
Sonia, what are you doing here?

297
00:11:16,167 --> 00:11:18,401
你离开华雷斯太快了  我都来不及说再见
You left Juarez so fast, I didn't get to say goodbye.

298
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:20,660
我们是姐妹  我们不应该争吵
We're sisters. We shouldn't fight.

299
00:11:21,140 --> 00:11:21,710
我想你
I miss you.

300
00:11:22,100 --> 00:11:24,020
知道了
Okay, got it.

301
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:25,952
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

302
00:11:26,900 --> 00:11:28,820
桑娅  抱歉  快进来
Sonia. I'm sorry. Come in.

303
00:11:29,140 --> 00:11:29,640
不行  我不能进
No, I couldn't.

304
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:31,300
能进  你千里迢迢来到这里
No, you came from so far away.

305
00:11:31,391 --> 00:11:32,257
快进来  坐一会儿
Come on in. Stay awhile.

306
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:33,344
谢谢  杰
Thank you, Jay.

307
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:34,980
墨西哥曲奇
The Mexican cookies.

308
00:11:34,980 --> 00:11:36,300
没想到能再看见它们
I never thought I'd see those again.

309
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:37,180
让我来帮你吃掉吧
Let me help you with those.

310
00:11:37,214 --> 00:11:38,808
-桑娅阿姨  -你好  曼尼
- Hey, Aunt Sonia. - Hola, Manny.

311
00:11:39,220 --> 00:11:40,940
我有一些行李在车上  来帮我吧
I have some luggage in the car. Come help me.

312
00:11:41,432 --> 00:11:42,380
-好  -去帮你阿姨吧  去吧
- Okay. - Help your aunt. Go ahead.

313
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:46,760
你为什么要让她进来
Why did you let her in?

314
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:47,800
你得跟她聊聊
You have to talk to her.

315
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:49,240
我真的觉得她是来道歉的
I really think she's here to apologize.

316
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:51,400
你不像我那么了解她
You don't know her like I do.

317
00:11:53,140 --> 00:11:54,936
等一下  你这是干什么
Ohh! Wait! What are you doing?!

318
00:11:55,844 --> 00:11:57,740
好极了  杰  现在她绑架了曼尼
Great, Jay. Now she kidnapped Manny.

319
00:11:59,700 --> 00:12:01,060
你怎么那么冷静
Why are you so calm?

320
00:12:01,060 --> 00:12:02,700
我们不是应该跟著他们或叫警察吗
Shouldn't we follow them or call the police?

321
00:12:02,905 --> 00:12:04,940
不  不过是绑架而已  在我家这很正常
No, it's just a kidnapping. It's normal in my family.

322
00:12:06,068 --> 00:12:07,467
绑架电话来了
Ransom call.

323
00:12:15,699 --> 00:12:17,167
妈妈  我真的很害怕
Mom, I'm really scare--

324
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:22,580
她要我用辣酱生意来交换曼尼
She wants my hot-sauce business in exchange for Manny.

325
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:24,349
太好了  那她就欠我们400美金了
Good! Then she owes us 400 bucks.

326
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,760
而且孩子还能回来了
We get the kid back.

327
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:26,720
没门
No deal.

328
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,560
我来解决
I'll handle it.

329
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:30,680
我的妹妹  我的问题
My sister, my problem.

330
00:12:30,680 --> 00:12:31,600
还是我的节日呢
My holiday!

331
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:37,040
孩子们刚停好车
Oh! That's the kids pulling up right now.

332
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,740
-表现正常一点  -我生来就很正常
- Just act normal. - I was born normal.

333
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:41,200
不对  他们说我出生时自带刘海
Not really. They said I came out with bangs.

334
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:43,822
现在我们只要口径一致就行了
Hey. Now all we have to do is stick the landing.

335
00:12:43,924 --> 00:12:45,420
别行为怪异露出破绽
Don't blow it by acting weird.

336
00:12:47,673 --> 00:12:49,501
-我很想你  -伙计
- Oh! I missed you! - Buddy!

337
00:12:49,511 --> 00:12:50,993
自驾游怎么样
Oh, how was the drive?!

338
00:12:51,003 --> 00:12:52,505
很不错
Oh, it was great.

339
00:12:52,515 --> 00:12:53,770
-没错  -是吗
- Yeah. - Yeah?

340
00:12:53,780 --> 00:12:55,380
我们本该很早就到的
We would have been here a lot earlier,

341
00:12:55,380 --> 00:12:56,730
但是路上太堵了...
but there was a ton of traffic on...

342
00:12:57,423 --> 00:12:59,181
美国路上
A-America.

343
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:01,500
我们去找外公怎么样
What do you say we go find Grandpa, huh?

344
00:13:01,550 --> 00:13:03,288
-好呀  -去吧  一起去吧
- Yes. - Here we go. Let's go.

345
00:13:03,408 --> 00:13:04,979
这周过得好吗
