523
00:18:59,580 --> 00:19:01,300
养大两个非同凡响的女儿
Raising two dynamite ladies

524
00:19:01,431 --> 00:19:04,840
还有夫复何求的最好的哥们
and the...best buddy a guy could ever ask for.

525
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:06,750
这是什么
Oh, what is with this?

526
00:19:06,832 --> 00:19:08,080
-今年没有疯狂面包吗  -对啊
- No crazy bread this year? - Yeah!

527
00:19:08,090 --> 00:19:09,887
我们在纽约又待了五天
We stayed in New York for five more days.

528
00:19:09,908 --> 00:19:11,180
我看到大卫·布莱恩在果冻里
And I saw David Blaine in jello,

529
00:19:11,281 --> 00:19:13,218
我一直超想告诉你  但她们不让
and I've been dying to tell you, but they wouldn't let me!

530
00:19:13,318 --> 00:19:14,024
你真是个废物
You're a disgrace.

531
00:19:14,165 --> 00:19:15,536
天啊  你们妈妈和我
Oh, my God! Your mother and I --

532
00:19:15,610 --> 00:19:17,310
非常愤怒  愤怒
Are furious! Furious!

533
00:19:17,310 --> 00:19:18,670
你们一直待在纽约
You were in New York this whole time,

534
00:19:18,683 --> 00:19:19,572
却什么都没告诉...
and you didn't say anything --

535
00:19:19,592 --> 00:19:21,500
听著  我不知道这一团糟是怎么回事
Now, I don't know what can of worms this is,

536
00:19:21,510 --> 00:19:23,140
但我知道这是我的节日
but I know this is my day,

537
00:19:23,150 --> 00:19:25,330
我要你们都冷静下来
and I want you to calm down.

538
00:19:25,970 --> 00:19:27,890
你口袋里有个手机吗
Is that a phone in your pocket?

539
00:19:28,530 --> 00:19:29,790
这是我的手机
That's my phone.

540
00:19:29,810 --> 00:19:31,954
我从昨天就在找这个手机了
I've been looking for this since yesterday.

541
00:19:31,964 --> 00:19:34,301
我会偷东西了
I steal now.

542
00:19:34,890 --> 00:19:36,230
菲尔  你给我发短信了吗
Phil, did you text me?

543
00:19:36,382 --> 00:19:38,398
是的  克莱尔让我给你发一张
Oh, yeah, um, claire asked me to send you a picture

544
00:19:38,418 --> 00:19:39,980
我们在纽约住的酒店里衣柜的照片
of the closet in our New York hotel.

545
00:19:39,990 --> 00:19:41,580
老天  这是你赤身裸体吗
Oh, my God! Is this you naked?!

546
00:19:42,090 --> 00:19:42,110
什么
What?

547
00:19:43,030 --> 00:19:43,430
为什么
Why?

548
00:19:44,590 --> 00:19:46,160
亲爱的  你能给我爸发张衣柜的照片吗
Honey, will you send my dad a picture of that closet

549
00:19:46,180 --> 00:19:46,730
免得我忘了
before I forget?

550
00:19:51,210 --> 00:19:52,010
天啊  不要
Oh! No.

551
00:19:52,010 --> 00:19:53,510
你们在吵什...
Hey. What's all the --

552
00:19:54,369 --> 00:19:54,873
好吧  不要  谢谢
O...kay. No, thanks.

553
00:19:54,893 --> 00:19:56,980
我已经对一个亲戚产生不明情愫了
I already have confusing feelings for one relative.

554
00:19:56,990 --> 00:20:00,458
好吧  这事就到此为止
All...right. Can this just be done now?

555
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:01,330
你是怎么...
How did you even --

556
00:20:01,330 --> 00:20:03,790
等等  照片背景在下雨
Wait a minute. It is raining in the background.

557
00:20:03,790 --> 00:20:05,550
但我们一起在纽约时根本没下雨
But it didn't rain while we were all there.

558
00:20:05,699 --> 00:20:07,200
纽约只有昨天才下了场雨
It only rained in New York yesterday.

559
00:20:07,210 --> 00:20:09,540
天啊  你们留在纽约居然不带我们
Oh, my God! You stayed in New York without us!

560
00:20:09,550 --> 00:20:10,441
我们说谎了
We're liars!

561
00:20:10,451 --> 00:20:11,844
对不起
I'm so sorry.

562
00:20:11,884 --> 00:20:14,580
不  是我的错  是我一直撒谎
No, it's my fault. I -- I kept the lie going.

563
00:20:14,590 --> 00:20:16,336
我们真的要忽略
Okay, are we really glossing over the fact

564
00:20:16,376 --> 00:20:17,330
我也能察觉出猫腻这事吗
that I figured something out?

565
00:20:17,470 --> 00:20:18,890
我来告诉你们还忽略了什么
I'll tell you what else we're glossing over --

566
00:20:18,890 --> 00:20:20,790
你们在父亲节表现多糟糕
how bad you all are at Father's Day.

567
00:20:20,810 --> 00:20:23,080
我一个儿子有偷盗癖
I've got one son who's a kleptomaniac,

568
00:20:23,090 --> 00:20:25,043
另一个喜欢上自己的亲姨
the other who's in love with his own aunt --

569
00:20:25,050 --> 00:20:26,550
即使照你的标准也太恶心人
creepy even by your standards --

570
00:20:26,550 --> 00:20:29,250
还有一个女儿  让我被迫看了她
and a daughter who I was forced to see naked

571
00:20:29,491 --> 00:20:30,397
像刚出生时赤裸的样子
as the day she was born.

572
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,589
来吧  小卡  来亲我这个娘炮
Come on, Cam. Kiss me like the sissy I am!

573
00:20:32,670 --> 00:20:34,690
-来的真是时候  -天啊
- Right on cue. - Oh, God.

574
00:20:34,690 --> 00:20:36,110
祝我自己父亲节快乐
Happy Father's Day to me.

575
00:20:36,110 --> 00:20:37,890
再来个锦上添花  我刚发现
Icing on the cake -- I just found out

576
00:20:37,890 --> 00:20:40,370
我的妻子有严重的恋父情结
my own wife has major daddy issues.

577
00:20:40,370 --> 00:20:43,110
让我不禁想这才是她和我一起的真正原因
Makes me wonder if that's the whole reason she's with me.

578
00:20:43,110 --> 00:20:44,190
老爸  别乱说
Dad, come on.

579
00:20:44,190 --> 00:20:46,150
我们或许毁了你的节日  我承认
We may have ruined your day, yes,

580
00:20:46,150 --> 00:20:47,450
但你现在只是在穿凿附会
but now you're just spiraling.

581
00:20:47,450 --> 00:20:50,030
每一段感情都有各自的问题
I mean, every relationship has its issues,

582
00:20:50,030 --> 00:20:51,510
但歌洛莉亚超级喜欢你
and Gloria adores you!

583
00:20:52,010 --> 00:20:53,130
享受这胜利吧
Take the win.

584
00:20:53,630 --> 00:20:54,430
你们真这么想吗
You think?

585
00:20:54,430 --> 00:20:56,390
爸爸真的好英俊
Papa was so handsome.

586
00:20:57,165 --> 00:20:59,076
-真的  -真的
- Yes! - Yes. Yes. Yes!

587
00:21:00,717 --> 00:21:01,868
好啦
All right!

588
00:21:04,730 --> 00:21:06,930
你们每人盘子里都有一根香肠
You each have a sausage on your plate

589
00:21:07,007 --> 00:21:09,626
我是根据你们每人的性格气质挑选的
I selected based on your individual personality and temperament.

590
00:21:10,150 --> 00:21:12,050
这是血肠吗  为什么我的是粉色
Is this blood sausage? Because mine's pink.

591
00:21:12,228 --> 00:21:12,934
我的也是粉红色...
Oh, my mine's pink, t--

592
00:21:13,290 --> 00:21:14,750
很好笑  老爸
Oh. Very funny, Dad.

593
00:21:14,750 --> 00:21:15,950
咬一口面包
Now take a bite of bread,

594
00:21:15,950 --> 00:21:17,950
抿一口水  净化一下味蕾
a sip of water to cleanse the palate.

595
00:21:17,950 --> 00:21:19,730
我的闻起来很辣
Mine smells spicy.

596
00:21:19,730 --> 00:21:21,950
来举个手  谁听到我说"闻闻香肠"了
Show of hands. Who heard me say "Smell your sausage"?

597
00:21:22,365 --> 00:21:23,937
盒子上说这些猪每天被按摩
The box said these pigs were massaged daily,

598
00:21:23,997 --> 00:21:24,823
然后从背后被杀
then killed from behind to

599
00:21:24,864 --> 00:21:26,543
免得让恐慌荷尔蒙污染了肉质
keep the panic hormone from tainting the meat.

600
00:21:27,112 --> 00:21:28,230
它们从背后被杀
They were murdered from behind?

601
00:21:29,070 --> 00:21:30,848
我要你们注意三件事
The three things I want you to pay attention to

602
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:32,545
香气  口感还有余味
are bouquet, texture, and finish.

603
00:21:32,585 --> 00:21:33,090
你们可以开始了
You may begin.

604
00:21:34,530 --> 00:21:35,630
能给我来点番茄酱吗
Can I have some ketchup?

605
00:21:36,038 --> 00:21:36,690
派对结束
We are done here.
